<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PanelDisplayDriver - UMDF 2 / IddCx indirect display driver.

  Requires the Windows Driver Kit. The WDK supplies the
  WindowsUserModeDriver10.0 platform toolset, the iddcx headers and
  IddCxStub.lib; without it MSBuild cannot even load this project.

  IddCx version is pinned to 1.2 (see IDDCX_VERSION_* below), which must stay in
  step with UmdfExtensions=IddCx0102 in PanelDisplayDriver.inf. Only IddCx 1.2
  APIs are used. To move to a newer class extension, raise both together.
-->
